    "## 5. 先检查一下梯度和参数更新\n",
    "\n",
    "在正式训练前，拿训练集中的同一小批数据，比较三件事：按公式算出的梯度、PyTorch 自动求导得到的梯度，以及手动更新参数与优化器更新的结果。\n",
    "\n",
    "这样比单看“最终损失降了”更直接：如果这些结果一致，至少说明这一步的公式和代码能对上。这里用的是临时参数，不会接着拿它们做主实验。\n",
    "\n",
    "`backward()` 负责求导；`step()` 负责更新参数；`zero_grad()` 清除上一次的梯度，因为 PyTorch 默认会累加梯度。\n",
    "\n",
    "手动更新参数时使用 `torch.no_grad()`，避免把更新操作也记录进求导过程。注意，**手动更新参数不等于手动求导**：下面的手动更新仍然可以使用自动求导得到的梯度。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 3,
   "id": "7c957971",
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-10-29T13:09:26.244879Z",
     "iopub.status.busy": "2026-10-29T13:09:26.244400Z",
     "iopub.status.idle": "2026-10-29T13:09:26.265165Z",
     "shell.execute_reply": "2026-10-29T13:09:26.263346Z"
    }
   },
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "解析梯度与自动求导一致，手动更新与优化器更新一致。\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "xb, yb = X_train[:BATCH_SIZE], y_train[:BATCH_SIZE]\n",
    "w_check = torch.tensor([[0.2], [-0.1]], requires_grad=True)\n",
    "b_check = torch.tensor([0.3], requires_grad=True)\n",
    "r = xb @ w_check + b_check - yb\n",
    "loss_check = r.square().mean() / 2\n",
    "loss_check.backward()\n",
    "analytic_w = xb.T @ r.detach() / len(xb)\n",
    "analytic_b = r.detach().mean(dim=0)\n",
    "torch.testing.assert_close(w_check.grad, analytic_w)\n",
    "torch.testing.assert_close(b_check.grad, analytic_b)\n",
    "\n",
    "check_model = nn.Linear(D, 1)\n",
    "with torch.no_grad():\n",
    "    check_model.weight.copy_(w_check.T)\n",
    "    check_model.bias.copy_(b_check)\n",
    "check_optimizer = torch.optim.SGD(check_model.parameters(), lr=LR)\n",
    "check_optimizer.zero_grad(set_to_none=True)\n",
    "check_prediction = check_model(xb)\n",
    "torch.testing.assert_close(check_prediction, xb @ w_check + b_check)\n",
    "(nn.functional.mse_loss(check_prediction, yb) / 2).backward()\n",
    "torch.testing.assert_close(check_model.weight.grad.T, analytic_w)\n",
    "torch.testing.assert_close(check_model.bias.grad, analytic_b)\n",
    "with torch.no_grad():\n",
    "    w_check -= LR * w_check.grad\n",
    "    b_check -= LR * b_check.grad\n",
    "check_optimizer.step()\n",
    "torch.testing.assert_close(check_model.weight.T, w_check)\n",
    "torch.testing.assert_close(check_model.bias, b_check)\n",
    "print('解析梯度与自动求导一致，手动更新与优化器更新一致。')"
   ]
  },
